      "id": "5402fc78-9547-4844-84cb-19e9b72b412b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        656,
        -496
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 608,
        "content": "## Google Maps Business Scraper - CoreClaw + CoreClaw In-built Enrichment + Firecrawl\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Initiates every 30 minutes and sets the enrichment platform.\n2. Reads pending queries from Google Sheets to start enrichment tasks.\n3. Routes queries to different scraping tasks based on conditions.\n4. Fetches and processes scrape results, splitting data for further enrichment.\n5. Appends the processed data back to Google Sheets for evaluation.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Set up Google Sheets API credentials to access spreadsheets.\n- [ ] Configure CoreClaw API for scraping functionalities.\n- [ ] Prepare Firecrawl API credentials for HTML scraping.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the scheduling interval based on your data requirements."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
